    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a lunar base. No memory. No explanation. No way to fight back.<br>Only the hum of failing machines... and something moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna: Obscura</strong> is a single-player psychological horror experience set in a remote moon base gone silent. With nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight, you must uncover the truth behind the base\u2019s eerie emptiness\u2014and your own forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic, escape-room-style puzzles. Avoid unseen threats. And above all... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Created by a small indie team of two\u2014a visual artist and a sound designer\u2014this is a handcrafted descent into isolation, fear, and forgotten memory.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a lunar base. No memory. No explanation. No way to fight back.<br>Only the hum of failing machines... and something moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna: Obscura</strong> is a single-player psychological horror experience set in a remote moon base gone silent. With nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight, you must uncover the truth behind the base\u2019s eerie emptiness\u2014and your own forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic, escape-room-style puzzles. Avoid unseen threats. And above all... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Created by a small indie team of two\u2014a visual artist and a sound designer\u2014this is a handcrafted descent into isolation, fear, and forgotten memory.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror game of hiding, solving, and surviving inside a haunted moon base",
